--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_ModularCurve_FullLevel_AuxLevelOne_exists_ringEquiv_adicCompletion_stalk_drinfeldChart_of_mem_ssJSet_of_pow_eq_mul_moduliHasse_of_isPrimitiveRoot_mul_of_dvd.lean

